  "body": "Coming from https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/issues/1679\r\n\r\nI'm trying to link to [`application/x-www-form-urlencoded`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#attr-fs-enctype-urlencoded) (in https://github.com/w3c/respec/issues/2913). Bikeshed data [shows](https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed-data/blob/260ae9181b3940eb7301a1446c64e3eddc09b206/data/anchors/anchors-ap.data#L888-L896) it as `element-attr` (Shepherd was not able to determine it's type correctly). It needs to be explicitly defined as an attribute value or a regular dfn, so other specs can properly link to it. I'm happy to send a PR if needed.",
